<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Consent compliance</h2>
<p>For consent compliance, audit consent capture and purchase-event suppression before the first flow goes live — every app must record consent compliance opt-ins you can evidence and halt promos at checkout. Consent Compliance audiences forgive plain creative; they do not forgive promos sent mid-refund or right after checkout.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8"><table>
<thead><tr><th>Audience state</th><th>Required handling</th><th>Why it matters</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>No documented consent</td><td>No consent compliance promos without proof; transactional messages only</td><td>Consent evidence underwrites all consent compliance sending</td></tr>
<tr><td>Consented, never purchased</td><td>Consent Compliance education and proof before any offer</td><td>Early consent compliance discounts train deal-waiting</td></tr>
<tr><td>Active cart, no checkout</td><td>Remind consent compliance carts with context first, no instant code</td><td>Guards consent compliance margin while intent peaks</td></tr>
<tr><td>Purchased recently</td><td>Pause consent compliance promos; switch to post-purchase teaching</td><td>Spares consent compliance buyers remorse and unsubscribes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Refund or return open</td><td>Consent Compliance selling waits for case resolution</td><td>Consent Compliance messaging lands badly during open cases</td></tr>
<tr><td>Repeated non-engagement</td><td>Sunset cold consent compliance contacts before complaints build</td><td>Consent Compliance deliverability depends on pruning</td></tr>
<tr><td>SMS consent present</td><td>Cap consent compliance SMS cadence within legal quiet windows</td><td>One consent compliance SMS complaint outweighs many email ones</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wholesale or B2B account</td><td>Consent Compliance B2B routing stays account-specific</td><td>Wholesale consent compliance terms forbid retail-style offers</td></tr>
<tr><td>Free or disposable email domain</td><td>Verify consent compliance throwaway addresses pre-journey</td><td>Low-grade consent compliance signups drag deliverability</td></tr>
<tr><td>Staff and test accounts</td><td>Consent Compliance QA profiles excluded from reporting</td><td>Consent Compliance test sends skew attribution reads</td></tr>
<tr><td>Competitor or researcher signals</td><td>Consent Compliance researcher signups follow standard consent</td><td>Manual consent compliance exceptions rot the audit trail</td></tr>
<tr><td>Legacy list without timestamps</td><td>Reconfirm consent compliance consent where timestamps are missing</td><td>Timestamp-less consent compliance consent is legal exposure</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
